    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rwoth kwero riyo kec m'ongoye adieri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro mar'aŋwen ma dhum pa Kere Dario, k'aŋwen ma dwe mar'abuŋwen, dwe ma Kislev, wac pa Rwoth obino ri Zekaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo oyido Bethel ooro Sareza kodi Regem Melek kodi cwo pajo, kwayo ruwaŋ Rwoth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi penjo jocway ri Were i wi migam m'oyido jonitie i Ot pa Rwoth pa lwak jolweny kodi jotuci wac Were ni, “Anyalo ywak kodi lokirok maleŋ i dwe mar'abic paka oyido atimo ma oro kweth pama?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac pa Rwoth pa lwak jolweny obino ran ka waco ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luw gi ji je ma piny kodi jocway ri Were i wi migam k'iwaco ni, “Ma oro piero ario, wiriyo kec to wiywak i dwe mar'abic kodi i dwe mar'abirio, i oro ario me, adieri obedo ran ma wiriy'iye kec? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosa ka wicemo to wimedho, k'obedo riwin wegi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'obedo gi wac pa Rwoth m'oluwo luwo i cingi jotuci wac Were ma cango, ma Yerusalem obed'iye m'okwe, kodi tindi madongo m'othoko go, yupiny ma Kanan kodi Sefela?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac pa Rwoth obino ri Zekaria ka waco ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth pa lwak jolweny waco ama: Thum banja g'adieri, nyuthi wor kodi ŋono kisi dhano ri nyawote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Citho, nyithindho kic, japath, kosa jacandi, ikir'idiy, kosa timo can marac ri nyawotin i cunyin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jokwero winjo, aka joyengo badi gin gi wictek, aka ithi gin obedo mapek ma jok'onyalo winjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotweyo cuny jo ma jok'owinjo cik kodi wac ma Rwoth pa lwak jolweny odhiro gi cuny pere luwo i cingi jotuci wac Were ma cango. Riameno keme madwoŋ obino wok bongi Rwoth pa lwak jolweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka paka go olwoŋo, to jok'onyalo winjo, ameno munyo jolwoŋo, go k'onyalo winjo, Rwoth pa lwak jolweny waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akedho jo g'asur i dier nonin je m'oyido fodi jokuya. Ameno lowo ma joweyo odoŋ m'ojwangere, m'ongoye ŋata oluw'iye kosa dwok'iye, lowo m'oyido ber to jwangere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
